 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Now war arose in heaven",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Michael and his angels fought the dragon",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The dragon and his angels fought back",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But he was defeated",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There was no longer any place for them in heaven",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The great dragon was thrown down",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That ancient serpent, the devil and Satan",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The deceiver of the whole world",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the salvation and the power",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the kingdom of our God have come",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They conquered him by the blood of the Lamb",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And by the word of their testimony",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The accuser of our brothers has been thrown down",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who accuses them day and night before our God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They loved not their lives even unto death",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Rejoice, O heavens, and you who dwell in them",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
